cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "mantel: Bloch-basis evaluation of the screened Coulomb interaction"
authors:
  - family-names: Bozier
    given-names: Kieran
    affiliation: "University of Cambridge"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-01-01"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/kieranbozier/mantel"
abstract: >
  mantel computes the screened Coulomb interaction matrix elements W(n,m,k)
  in the Bloch basis using DFT wavefunctions and a dielectric matrix from
  Yambo. It uses FFT-based density products and supports OpenMP parallelisation
  over k-points.
keywords:
  - "screened Coulomb interaction"
  - "GW approximation"
  - "many-body perturbation theory"
  - "density functional theory"
  - Fortran
  - FFTW
